less used together with `--headless`. E.g. `--dump-gdextension-interface` still shows a window by default.\r\n\r\nWe have `Main::is_cmdline_tool()` for most of these which could maybe be used here, especially if we were to change logic to imply that `cmdline_tool` means headless. I believe we wanted to do that in the past, but there might have been hurdles with headless mode that stopped it. CC @Calinou who might remember.","created_at":"2025-11-28T11:50:05Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T11:50:05Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113267#discussion_r2571413253","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113267","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2571413253"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113267#discussion_r2571413253"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113267"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2571413253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":82,"original_start_line":82,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":97,"original_line":95,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":17,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2571440657","pull_request_review_id":3518695250,"id":2571440657,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZRRIR","diff_hunk":"@@ -79,6 +79,21 @@ class OS_MacOS : public OS_Unix {\n \tvirtual void delete_main_loop() override;\n \n public:\n+\tstatic inline const char *headless_args[] = {\n+\t\t\"--headless\",\n+\t\t\"-h\",\n+\t\t\"--help\",\n+\t\t\"/?\",\n+\t\t\"--version\",\n+\t\t\"--dump-gdextension-interface\",\n+\t\t\"--dump-extension-api\",\n+\t\t\"--dump-extension-api-with-docs\",\n+\t\t\"--validate-extension-api\",\n+\t\t\"--convert-3to4\",\n+\t\t\"--validate-conversion-3to4\",\n+\t\t\"--doctoo